      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Neurolysis of the coeliac plexus using 45 per cent alcohol was performed by the percutaneous posterior route. Bilateral blockade was always done. Effective in immediate relief was obtained in 88 per cent of the cases and was maintained in 73 per cent one month later."},
